# 1.1 PK1: the dpkg status of a computer that has the Graphite 1.0 System set (Debian 13 required and important,
# the 0.8.x set and the 136 packages the 1.0 set added), reduced to the fields apt resolves with. Made from the
# simulated owner system of the 1.0 System set (b100 R1, admin_updated). tools/build_repo.sh resolves the kit
# against it, so the kit carries what such a computer lacks, at the versions it needs. Comment lines are dropped
# before apt reads it.
